OL,3,GNEWSAHospital ward closure confirmed
OL,4,
OL,5,FHealth bosses have supported a
OL,6,Frecommendation to permanently close a
OL,7,Fhospital ward in East Yorkshire.
OL,9,FThe Humber and North Yorkshire
OL,10,FIntegrated Care Board announced in
OL,11,FApril that it would shut Bridlington
OL,12,FCare Unit (BCU) in June, which looks
OL,13,Fafter people after they receive medical
OL,14,Ftreatment.
OL,16,FYork and Scarborough Teaching Hospitals
OL,17,FNHS Foundation Trust said it would
OL,18,Fconsider feedback, but has now
OL,19,Fconfirmed the unit will close and it
OL,20,Fwill move to a "community-based" model
OL,21,Fof care.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
