OL,3,GNEWSAHospital ward closure confirmed
OL,4,
OL,5,FChief Executive Clare Smith said: "This
OL,6,Fdecision was not taken lightly, and we
OL,7,Frecognise the strength of feeling in
OL,8,FBridlington, not just about the care
OL,9,Funit but about the hospital's future
OL,10,Fmore broadly."
